{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_192b3041acb3db583e0dfc43750e01e6f0cab241bc87c227acf4d3a1da7a4ecd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_290a7d800c55aa2d3674637ab79d029221baea1e05b1d019d7efa15b070faeb4","slc_7f17900c2afbf4bad56ab4b9bb3fd0b16a1d2a105b8f3a23548a520d013e5fad","slc_dac21739d091bf114360479f9802da02992aa7f9a905bd3b784bf052521305e3"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"Every write is recorded in an append-only event log; clu history shows one issue's timeline and clu log filters the global stream by actor, kind, issue, or time window, with the actor resolved from --agent or $USER.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1f85cd6e3e400bf943c5b23fdeceee6fb900770b65eef929b4843eade7d10e5d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5b158629dfeb1142ee75dba004f48952e17a77524588e38ff266fdcec76f2603","slc_9d629952e339785f1c967cebcab7f3cd5738415f4f44cfb9e048747f7f06b63d"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"clu is local-first: a single binary over one SQLite file at .clu/data.sqlite, with no daemon, server, account, or network access; config.yaml is committed while the DB is gitignored.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2343ef742e1d6c68ce88d6877e3e259127f62289472efa26095c23a25d21b4ab","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_523f5496666f77e170c699ac7859829e83e6058df63da7859b16d291c155ca9b","slc_9d629952e339785f1c967cebcab7f3cd5738415f4f44cfb9e048747f7f06b63d"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"The project is written in Go (badges indicate Go 1.26+) and uses the pure-Go modernc.org/sqlite driver, so it needs no CGo or system SQLite libraries.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4762820a9919a22d7c52360ab82efbd53f0fe613caab24203c3fbe8e388d40cd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2a4fef54f5d80dd6632c46972fb79f9662bd05c3b9ecb4613b0fac9c59b61a04","slc_5896932d99f0039d33bf46c0d992dd7037b79dbd06de4f6ef74f59cd3d42955b","slc_837f3fd2227aaa1675e46285b55095bd51561addc2466efef8c6166ebb74b402"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046","src_a3fd4f00274653a785c215fd6869dfb2"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are told to run go build ./... && go test ./... before every commit, exercise demo.sh and demo-workflow.sh as end-to-end smoke tests, and follow CLAUDE.md conventions such as one file per kong command and entity-specific sentinel errors.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_498f544aa4dcb531a2058a78f9a2edb3f03da53645882055a6cb0865be550782","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_92e51177f3aca96295b53bdf198515fc0e6c0974489eaa59be611115f2433cdb","slc_b39b57fb4ec6c02a2831d01cc6fa24e2ee32453ecab023a5888aa10b6667e276"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"Agents are declared in .clu/config.yaml with capabilities; capability-tagged issues in the default lane flow to whichever agent advertises that capability, or coordinators can assign directly with -a.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4dda02683c30cda8b08bbfbf77729daac24860772b04d72f2761c54f407d5e09","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_172b780bf984bc1eda9e04993c7ccf6ee78b4a7c3f7a1f61237650b444b8e075","slc_9eaca5c5c4424b819e745f7cb22b00f2830e14572fa62258b9f43f7af570ed95","slc_b0309cab7f688b4667dca796db194361a5e0f972b452c452b3101296a1a189d9"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"Status semantics: closed issues unblock dependents, cancelled issues leave dependents blocked, and clu cancel cascades cancellation to all transitive descendants; milestone issues auto-close when their dependencies close.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_735fb0047d297ebb8d3bbd1f86c0e23ea5441286d6e53dc095c1006df951150a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5f70f1d6ce1c64104f55797228a00c00968b43a5d93f7e746e99b079153f8c80","slc_f8508b76c22c3bbff765f74a62a9be2a71a4b01a185ce210f45fb57791c898c5"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"The project explicitly excludes being a live server-backed sync layer, a generic project-management tool, a live GitHub/Linear/Jira bridge, or an agent runtime; sync across machines is manual push/pull and marked experimental.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7884fc4d50d800e3e258e554857b286bd0602ac6201b56c7652e32126f506422","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9d629952e339785f1c967cebcab7f3cd5738415f4f44cfb9e048747f7f06b63d"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"Claims are atomic via an UPDATE ... RETURNING query with a subquery, so racing agents receive different issues rather than colliding on the same task.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_807a85aa25ddb22a9c690cc33c372bf030666323ceefe7818e3547b8b515d832","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d9dc61f32add6646c9fa324ebfdb74cd2e10716abcad2fb80b7fbf4a6be3676","slc_5b158629dfeb1142ee75dba004f48952e17a77524588e38ff266fdcec76f2603"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"clu is a SQLite-backed issue tracker CLI intended for coordinating AI coding agents working on a single machine.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_826168e8357e786653d8b27a1cf61d27287ceb7a263da3bf0bd8f8a0173d0f3d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a284ef22c72f12c7e559bf44d1d230b8795cc761a5d3030b0e37f7fb6cc0cd79","slc_a8f9dbeda97cd7640940d77b783314110c9fb22567310d7cff30b27993815da7","slc_cd4cbcabb0974d4871561d7a1fb98b378035feafd47f3953e4e67ecbe6769c3b"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"clu batch accepts a JSON array of issues referencing each other by alias, validates the whole graph (acyclic, resolvable references, valid fields), and writes it in one transaction; a key field makes re-runs idempotent with --on-existing skip or update.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ccb4eea8cd264cd1b115d878078b1594aa9197a8c76e89a00cff7e539a31554","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_599fdfc5825b39045cf8a394ec84e3bf9f121a142400fd32e15f6f0ccf89297b","slc_623a30e9542b662b4a012f660be6ba14e35b0dc8c9e2e3c783f77ceb45427e1a"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"clu web serves a local read/write dashboard on port 5757 over the same SQLite file, backed by an in-process REST API that clu http can expose standalone; it includes a kanban board, issue list, dependency graph, and approvals queue.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c5db8606c5a0f94fc1f0054a07dafe0b560d9df5d3d0416d7acf5dc1907edb8a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_96198a7e8224a6c0d5bcc328b9717d0edacf73e2dad89d7c03fc88499fe5b279","slc_9a0510d06258edb39faf78c31bcda550df18ef55048c8b62bbcfc545da93b0a2","slc_e74ead4f876a755ad6ccdceb94c60649c48d2ccfc9ee988804b6d4d4b7858284"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"clu agent start launches a configured agent command with layered prompts (shared .clu/agents/_shared/ markdown prepended to per-agent prompts) and heartbeats it; the command is runtime-agnostic (e.g. claude or codex).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c6ec23c91aff3f8c8a8d63669299c86c56b5e8685bb71968ff528addc131e503","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6b686fba665ae55c2e7d4c51f01c07d7c92d6c15396c63c86cb3b4dadab2f56a","slc_f8508b76c22c3bbff765f74a62a9be2a71a4b01a185ce210f45fb57791c898c5"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"Coordination primitives include TTL'd named locks (clu lock with auto-release), fire-and-forget inter-agent messaging (clu ping / clu inbox), git worktree bootstrapping, and an experimental clu sync that stores issue state as JSONL on a refs/clu/store git ref.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cb51967f16c338ff97592f8ab3ef5b13c9405b7895c26980574562f28e9c036b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6b86d4421cc78f490f8e9e5d8b91badfdc773257cff57ca8a6411c0d346cf0bd"],"source_ids":["src_a3fd4f00274653a785c215fd6869dfb2"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs breaking batch work into per-group commits that compile and pass tests, fixing bugs in priority order with separate commits, and running an end-to-end smoke test before declaring multi-file features done.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","created_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d8f72c3f6bec6017379865c1a7d3abd8dd8e35f6194faae4de0157a34b0ec8dd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"arjia-labs/clu@90db9ca81b89 snapshot 09fed11b9ad5694a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_53718524677e047d679a246960b180305ae1cb97a2fdbab14d6c75be9653b7b3","slc_a24b5d6d46903aec66db976301c521199002b2334f21d9327a978a4ad14b91f6","slc_b32bca337f0e35b111fcbab7f2444ed5b63be4edb098427be07ac66f1e33c66e","slc_c13ef90300f7c14f5b1d5e1bd5cd4940c3effbb57b3b2ff34afce4ba47724a5a"],"source_ids":["src_0e41427458db5111b4aba1e956ea7046"],"text":"The core CLI loop is clu init, create (with -p priority and -d dependency wiring), ready, claim --context, and close, with clu brief printing an agent guide plus declared and live agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:02Z","updated_by_operation":"op_be59827b3be54f25a5bba1301d21119a"}
